  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39afd3b78512f5a1",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Gemini 3.8 Live 附带 Live Avatar",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba1ed603ac36127e",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 附带 Live Avatar 为 Gemini 的对话式 AI 带来实时视觉存在。通过将我们的实时对话能力与低延迟流媒体视频原生耦合，Live Avatar 为企业及其用户提供了更自然、更直观的对话体验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19051dd61a7119a2",
      "translationZh": "软件工程师，代表 Gemini 音频团队",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e95642bdcefa4294",
      "translationZh": "基于上周 Gemini 3.8 Live 发布的势头，今天我们很高兴推出 Gemini 3.8 Live 附带 Live Avatar —— 为我们的原生实时对话模型带来近实时视觉存在。通过将近实时视频生成与语音相结合，Live Avatar 功能创造了一种能够倾听、观察和说话的动态视觉形象体验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78de79f2e339682f",
      "translationZh": "凭借精准的唇部同步、自然的表情和流畅的轮流发言，Live Avatar 使企业能够以更互动的方式扩展其虚拟产品。无论是提供引人入胜的客户服务还是进行互动式演练，它都能将数字互动转变为更丰富、更易于访问的体验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e50dba8cad7857d4",
      "translationZh": "从今天起，Gemini 3.8 Live 附带 Live Avatar 在 Gemini Enterprise 中提供。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff36610c86f0b0f6",
      "translationZh": "了解 Gemini 3.8 Live 附带 Live Avatar 如何支持多种角色，每个角色都具有独特的外观、声音和表现力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "faf094f03764ac92",
      "translationZh": "更自然且多模态的对话",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f054d990d74d337f",
      "translationZh": "对话本质上是多模态的：我们通过倾听、观察、说话和使用面部表情来交流。Live Avatar 将这些能力带给企业代理。通过同时处理视觉和音频输入，它能生成丰富的对话，提供更全面的体验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2750fb3b6719af1a",
      "translationZh": "观看 Gemini 3.8 Live 与 Live Avatar 如何在近实时情况下接收其所见和所闻的信息，并以富有表现力的音频和视频进行响应，以实现更自然的对话。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4a334bd60f53ce44",
      "translationZh": "带有持续存在的异步工具执行",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28df4a9945893128",
      "translationZh": "除了视觉存在之外，该功能还得益于 Gemini 的高级推理能力。通过异步工具调用，Live Avatar 能够在后台触发工具调用并获取数据，同时保持活跃对话，处理复杂任务并确保对话流程不间断。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce33e436a41902b8",
      "translationZh": "观看 Gemini 3.8 Live 与 Live Avatar 如何处理诸如在酒店办理客人入住之类的复杂任务。在对话持续不间断的情况下，后台调用工具。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b2b666ced1be5024",
      "translationZh": "面向全球规模构建的对话体验",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce20db21ec6e591a",
      "translationZh": "对话存在应感觉自然且不受语言限制。Live Avatar 具备原生的多语言语音到语音同步功能。该功能能够动态调整唇部同步和表情，并在不降低视频保真度或引入视觉漂移的情况下，在 97 种语言之间无缝切换。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ead0671948de841",
      "translationZh": "观看 Gemini 3.8 Live Avatar 如何在对话过程中实时切换语言，其唇部同步和表情能够在 97 种语言之间无缝适应。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "790a5228a3cc54d1",
      "translationZh": "满足品牌需求的 Live Avatar",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa32e98dcd1b72d1",
      "translationZh": "组织通常需要独特的视觉身份来契合其品牌。除了多样化的预设头像库外，组织还可以自定义其 Live Avatar。从高质量参考图像，开发者可以生成完全动画化、响应式的头像，同时保持参考相似度、品牌样式或角色身份。自定义头像创建目前仅通过企业白名单提供。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "804fdcb4d5aff51f",
      "translationZh": "信任与透明度是其核心",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eb507fa124a7785",
      "translationZh": "我们在构建 Live Avatar 时加入了严格的防护措施，旨在尊重身份并保持 AI 生成内容的透明度。我们的 AI 产品生成的所有输出均嵌入了 SynthID 水印。这种不可感知的水印直接编织到音频和视频输出中，有助于确保 AI 生成内容可被检测，以帮助减少错误信息和误归因。要了解我们全面的安全与负责任部署方法，请阅读我们的模型卡。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5d66704bf169ccd0",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 Gemini 3.8 Live 与 Live Avatar",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32aa3baba3806235",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 与 Live Avatar 在 Gemini Enterprise 中提供。探索 API 文档以开始使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
